    given-names: "Ibrahima Mohamed"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23950815"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23950814"
repository-code: "https://github.com/diarraibrahimamohamed-ops/nexora_v2"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  N3XORA v2.0.0 is an open-source, self-hostable platform for bioinformatics
  and computational research. It combines DNA/RNA sequence analysis,
  molecular structure and exploratory docking workflows, scientific
  provenance, evidence management, African phytochemical resources, and
  LC-MS/MS data-processing and curation workflows. Computational outputs
  are exploratory and do not establish experimental bioactivity,
  therapeutic efficacy, safety, or clinical validity.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - computational research
  - molecular docking
  - phytochemistry
  - African natural products
  - LC-MS/MS
  - scientific workflows
  - research reproducibility
